{"version":1,"content":"<p>老戲骨尹揚明早年憑《古惑仔》中「韓賓」一角上位後片約不斷，豈料因沉迷賭博輸盡身家，要靠親友救濟還清賭債，決心戒賭的他其後淡出轉行做死人生意大翻身，賺了過千萬身家，現年68歲的他還定居珠海安享晚年。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T04:24:06.948342+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":109,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T04:01:37+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T04:18:19.576886+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T04:18:19.576886+00:00","content_hash":"c0c0695960bb85b286de23d5f58dd195e1efa425c052e67584193c67da568bb1","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}